# eye layers: drawn over the body at their slot
sprite eye-shut 3x1
EEE

sprite eye-look 2x2
WE
EE

sprite eye-shut-hero 4x2
BBBB
EEEE

stage mark 16x14
pose mark rest mark

stage favicon 16x16
slot favicon cut 1 2
pose favicon rest mark-14@cut

stage companion 26x22
slot companion prop 18 0
slot companion spout 18 0
slot companion eye-shut 12 14
slot companion eye-look 13 13
pose companion rest companion
pose companion think companion bubbles@prop
pose companion read companion document@prop
pose companion write companion pencil@prop
pose companion run companion wrench@prop
pose companion needs-you companion ask@prop eye-look@eye-look
pose companion done companion spout@spout
pose companion sleep companion zzz@prop eye-shut@eye-shut

# hero ships three poses. The 8x8 props are specks at this size and have no slot here.
stage hero 42x37
slot hero spout 29 0
slot hero zzz 30 0
slot hero eye-shut 22 25
pose hero rest hero
pose hero done hero spout-hero@spout
pose hero sleep hero zzz-hero@zzz eye-shut-hero@eye-shut
